# Stereo: the MIX view's PANS page, and a part's pan on its SENDS page.
wait 300
tap LFO
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
shot s01_pans.png
turn K1 -40
turn K3 30
wait 1200
shot s02_panned.png
expect sound5.0.3 24
expect sound5.2.3 94
# a drum voice's PAN: the 909's kick, knob 2 of MIX's 909 MIX page (the black keys pick the track)
tap LFO
expect part 0
turn SELECT -9
turn SELECT 3
tapkey b0
turn K2 -24
wait 1200
shot s03_bd_pan.png
expect sound0.0.8 40
